{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐和身体感受提示相对概括，缺少X那种随乐句推进的具体变化，细腻度和贴乐程度略逊。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把叙事固定在左侧、感受放在右侧，扫读路径稳定，完整的叙述也更容易让人理解人物每次犹疑的缘由，以及前后心理变化的联系。X用【】突出关键点，并且通过到时出现的感受词更具体地贴合音乐进程，在抓取重点和感受细腻度上更有优势。但综合考虑边听边扫的实际体验，我选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "14cc70df-74e5-4b36-a598-71fe393a7d8a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T001923688879Z", "elapsed_seconds": 65.89, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:20:29.588758+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bd77d3d5f3ed0bb90113bc1d0c2700d50c9aa51bab62cc59374fe2eae80add7e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a73707